    "New: mixing cauldron" : {},
    "Mixing cauldron" : {},
    "Pour one ingredient onto the other inside the iron cauldron and they brew a new potion. The card under it shows its recipe." : {},
    "Pair by pair" : {},
    "Each poured layer mixes with one layer below it into two layers of the new potion. Poured layers left over stay on top." : {},
    "Only in the cauldron" : {},
    "Outside the cauldron potions never mix. Brew just as much as the recipe needs to fill flasks with one potion each." : {},
